ences have narrowed her trust in other people","chinese":"不愉快的经历使她不大相信别人了"}]},{"id":"narrow:o:91002c530dd3","label":"vt.","definitionZh":"眯起","glossesEn":["cause to close"],"contexts":["one's eyes"]},{"id":"narrow:o:4e5a92bbaad9","label":"vt.","definitionZh":"收紧","glossesEn":["make tighter"],"contexts":["dress","sleeves"]},{"id":"narrow:o:fb810be355a3","label":"n. pl.","definitionZh":"海峡","glossesEn":["of sea"]},{"id":"narrow:o:4506532cae9c","label":"n. pl.","definitionZh":"峡谷","glossesEn":["of river"]}]},"no":{"senses":[{"id":"no:o:7c08eea5c3b6","label":"int.","definitionZh":"不","glossesEn":["giving negative response, expressing disagreement, shock, disappointment"],"examples":[{"english":"are you ready? — no, I'm not","chinese":"你准备好了吗？──没有，我没准备好"},{"english":"another drink? — no thanks","chinese":"再喝一杯？──不了，谢谢"},{"english":"no! don't touch it: it's hot!","chinese":"别！别碰它，很烫！"}]},{"id":"no:o:d2c8fc3858b1","label":"int.","definitionZh":"没错","glossesEn":["expressing agreement or affirmation"],"examples":[{"english":"it's not very good, is it? — no, you're right: it isn't","chinese":"它不太好，对吧？──没错，你说得对，它不好"}]},{"id":"no:o:0fed6dbb0cf6","label":"det.","definitionZh":"没有","glossesEn":["not any"],"examples":[{"english":"to have no coat/job/money/shoes","chinese":"没有外套/工作/钱/鞋子"},{"english":"he has no intention of going","chinese":"他毫无走的意思"},{"english":"there's no chocolate like Belgian chocolate","chinese":"比利时巧克力无与伦比"}]},{"id":"no:o:2de1eb07411b","label":"det.","definitionZh":"不可能","glossesEn":["expressing impossibility"],"examples":[{"english":"there's no denying that …","chinese":"不可否认的是…"},{"english":"there's no doing sth","chinese":"没有做某事的可能"},{"english":"there's no telling how he'll react","chinese":"谁也不知道他会有何反应"}]},{"id":"no:o:75b8b83f4f53","label":"det.","definitionZh":"禁止","glossesEn":["prohibiting"],"examples":[{"english":"'no parking'","chinese":"禁止停车"},{"english":"no talking!","chinese":"不要说话！"},{"english":"no surrender!","chinese":"绝不投降！"}]},{"id":"no:o:b9ec8